dh-alert-internal-bleeding-name = [color=red]Internal bleeding[/color]
dh-alert-internal-bleeding-desc = You are bleeding inside where no wound shows. Tranexamic acid and etamsylate slow it; only a surgeon stops it.
dh-alert-shrapnel-name = [color=orange]Shrapnel[/color]
dh-alert-shrapnel-desc = Shrapnel or bullets are stuck in your wounds: pain and slow blood loss. Surgery removes them.
dh-alert-tourniquet-name = [color=red]Tourniquet[/color]
dh-alert-tourniquet-desc = Blood flow to the limb is cut off. The timer shows when tissue starts dying: after 10 minutes the limb is lost.
dh-alert-organ-failure-name = [color=red]Organ failure[/color]
dh-alert-organ-failure-desc = An internal organ is destroyed and does not work. Without surgery (or a transplant) you will only get worse.
dh-alert-pain-suppressed-name = [color=lightblue]Painkillers[/color]
dh-alert-pain-suppressed-desc = The pain is dulled by medicine, but the wounds are still there. It comes back when the drug wears off.
dh-alert-omnireazin-name = [color=lightgreen]Omnireazine[/color]
dh-alert-omnireazin-desc = Green cross: the drug is working, light wounds knit and pain is dulled. With a red burst: it has worn off and the pain is coming back.
dh-alert-phantom-pain-name = [color=violet]Phantom pain[/color]
dh-alert-phantom-pain-desc = Long-healed wounds ache. Too many fights on omnireazine; nothing takes this pain away.
dh-alert-withdrawal-name = [color=orange]Withdrawal[/color]
dh-alert-withdrawal-desc = Your body craves the drug it got used to (white pill: opioids, blue: sedatives, yellow: stimulants). A dose relieves it; dependence fades with time.
dh-alert-respiratory-depression-name = [color=red]Respiratory depression[/color]
dh-alert-respiratory-depression-desc = Opioids, sedatives and alcohol together depress your breathing: you are suffocating. Naloxone and flumazenil reverse them.
dh-alert-overdose-name = [color=red]Overdose[/color]
dh-alert-overdose-desc = Some drug in your blood is above its safe level. Take no more; activated charcoal and antidotes help.
dh-alert-medical-machine-name = [color=lightgreen]On a machine[/color]
dh-alert-medical-machine-desc = Lungs: a ventilator breathes for you. Heart: a life support system keeps you alive.
dh-alert-clinical-death-name = [color=red]Clinical death[/color]
dh-alert-clinical-death-desc = Grey heart: the timer to brain death, after which resuscitation is impossible. Red heart with a pulse: CPR or life support keeps the brain alive and the timer stops.
dh-alert-radiation-name = [color=yellow]Radiation[/color]
dh-alert-radiation-desc = Your accumulated radiation dose. The bigger the sign, the worse the radiation sickness. Prussian blue and potassium iodide flush it out.
dh-alert-chronite-name = [color=violet]Chronite[/color]
dh-alert-chronite-desc = Chronite builds up in your skin and never leaves on its own. Chronosorb in the early stage, skin excision later.
dh-alert-no-signal-name = [color=red]No signal[/color]
dh-alert-no-signal-desc = You are out of range of a working relay: your radio neither sends nor receives.
